{"sha": "19f6061dee6588a98a818c02f3d4ffe8a0bf8874ce7de4ac7e7f543d66f16e40", "body": ["\\chapter{三角形与角}\\label{ch:g7:triangles}", "", "能否画一个三边长分别为 $10$、$3$、$2$ 的三角形？能否画一个", "三个内角分别为 $80^\\circ$、$70^\\circ$、$50^\\circ$ 的三角形？本章用", "平面几何中两个最有用的事实来回答这两个问题：三角形不等式", "与 $180^\\circ$ 内角和定理。此外，本章还介绍", "相交直线与平行线所涉及的角的词汇。", "", "\\section{相交直线周围的角}", "", "\\begin{definition}[成对的角]\\label{def:g7:triangles:pairs}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 两角的度数之和为 $90^\\circ$ 时，称为\\emph{互余}；若两角的度数之和为", "        两角的度数之和为", "        $180^\\circ$ 时，称为\\emph{互补}。", "  \\item 两条直线相交时，交点两侧相对的", "        角称为\\emph{对顶", "        角}\\index{对顶角}。", "  \\item 一条直线与另外两条直线相交时，", "        在每个交点处位置相同的角称为", "        \\emph{同位角}；位于两直线之间、", "        截线两侧的角称为\\emph{内错", "        角}\\index{内错角}。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[角的相等关系]\\label{thm:g7:triangles:equalities}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 对顶角相等。", "  \\item 若两直线平行，则同位角相等，", "        内错角也相等。反之，若同位角", "        （或内错角）相等，则两直线平行。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[1 的证明]", "位于直线同一侧的两个角 $\\widehat{1}$ 与 $\\widehat{2}$ 构成一个平角，", "即 $\\widehat 1 + \\widehat 2 = 180^\\circ$。", "$\\widehat 3$ 是 $\\widehat 1$ 的对顶角，同样满足", "$\\widehat 2 + \\widehat 3 = 180^\\circ$（理由相同）。于是", "$\\widehat 1 = 180^\\circ - \\widehat 2 = \\widehat 3$。第 2 条", "在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.0,-0.9) -- (2.0,0.9);", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.0,0.9) -- (2.0,-0.9);", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (0.75,0) arc (0:24.2:0.75);", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (-0.75,0) arc (180:204.2:0.75);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (1.15,0.28) {$\\widehat 1$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (-1.15,-0.28) {$\\widehat 3$};", "  \\draw[omThm, ->] (0.55,0.25) arc (24.2:155.8:0.6);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (0,0.75) {$\\widehat 2$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.2,-1.0) -- (2.2,-1.0);", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.2,0.8) -- (2.2,0.8);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (-1.6,-1.6) -- (1.6,1.5);", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (-0.28,-1.0) ++(0.75,0) arc (0:44:0.75);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (0.85,-0.62) {$\\widehat a$};", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (0.63,0.8) ++(0.75,0) arc (0:44:0.75);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (1.76,1.18) {$\\widehat b$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：对顶角 $\\widehat 1 = \\widehat 3$", "（二者均与 $\\widehat 2$ 互补）。右图：两条平行线被", "第三条直线所截，同位角 $\\widehat a$ 与 $\\widehat b$", "相等。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{三角形的内角和}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[三角形内角和]\\label{thm:g7:triangles:sum}", "在任意三角形中，三个内角之和为 $180^\\circ$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $ABC$ 为三角形，过 $A$ 作", "与 $(BC)$ 平行的直线。在顶点 $A$ 处，三个角沿此平行线排列，", "构成一个平角 $180^\\circ$：中间的角为", "$\\widehat{A}$，两侧的角分别与", "$\\widehat B$、$\\widehat C$ 为内错角（平行线！），", "因此它们分别等于 $\\widehat B$ 与 $\\widehat C$。由此可得", "$\\widehat B + \\widehat A + \\widehat C = 180^\\circ$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.15]", "  \\coordinate (B) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (4.2,0);", "  \\coordinate (A) at (1.6,2.0);", "  \\draw[thick] (B) -- (C) -- (A) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (-0.3,2.0) -- (3.9,2.0);", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (A) {$A$};", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small] at (B) {$B$};", "  \\node[below right, font=\\small] at (C) {$C$};", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (0.55,0) arc (0:51.3:0.55);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (0.95,0.32) {$\\widehat B$};", "  \\draw[omMeth, ->] (3.68,0) arc (180:142.4:0.52);", "  \\node[omMeth, font=\\small] at (3.25,0.3) {$\\widehat C$};", "  \\draw[omDef, ->] (A) ++(-0.55,0) arc (180:231.3:0.55);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (0.85,1.75) {$\\widehat B$};", "  \\draw[omMeth, ->] (A) ++(0.52,0) arc (0:-37.6:0.52);", "  \\node[omMeth, font=\\small] at (2.35,1.78) {$\\widehat C$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 证明图示：沿与 $(BC)$ 平行且过 $A$ 的直线，", "角 $\\widehat B$、$\\widehat A$、$\\widehat C$（内错角，颜色对应）", "恰好拼成一个平角。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}